{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-3","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2011,"convocatoria":"Reserva 3","documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_3.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-3-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dada la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=ax^3+bx^2+cx\\), determina \\(a\\), \\(b\\) y \\(c\\) sabiendo que su gráfica tiene un punto de inflexión en \\((1,0)\\), y que la recta tangente en ese punto tiene por ecuación \\(y=-3x+3\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f'(x)=3ax^2+2bx+c,\\qquad f''(x)=6ax+2b\\]<p><b>Inflexión en </b>\\((1,0)\\)<b>:</b> \\(f(1)=a+b+c=0\\) y \\(f''(1)=6a+2b=0\\). <b>Tangente </b>\\(y=-3x+3\\)<b> en </b>\\(x=1\\)<b>:</b> su pendiente es \\(-3\\), así que \\(f'(1)=3a+2b+c=-3\\) (y pasa por \\((1,0)\\) ✓).</p><p>De \\(b=-3a\\) y \\(c=-a-b=2a\\): \\(3a-6a+2a=-a=-3\\iff a=3\\), \\(b=-9\\), \\(c=6\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=3,\\ b=-9,\\ c=6\\): \\(f(x)=3x^3-9x^2+6x\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"curv","apartados":""},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-3-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas por \\(f(x)=4-3|x|\\) y \\(g(x)=x^2\\).","apartados":["(1 p.) Esboza las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\). Determina sus puntos de corte.","(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) son dos semirrectas que se unen en \\((0,4)\\) (pendientes \\(\\mp3\\)); \\(g\\) es la parábola \\(y=x^2\\). Las dos son pares. Cortes con \\(x\\ge0\\): \\(4-3x=x^2\\iff x^2+3x-4=0\\iff x=1\\) (la otra raíz, \\(-4\\), no vale); por simetría, \\(x=-1\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 210' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='90.9,120.3 92.9,117.5 94.8,114.8 96.8,112.0 98.8,109.2 100.8,106.4 102.7,103.6 104.7,100.8 106.7,98.0 108.6,95.2 110.6,92.5 112.6,89.7 114.5,86.9 116.5,84.1 118.5,81.3 120.5,78.5 122.4,75.7 124.4,73.0 126.4,70.2 128.3,67.4 130.3,64.6 132.3,61.8 134.2,59.0 136.2,56.2 138.2,53.4 140.2,50.7 142.1,47.9 144.1,45.1 146.1,42.3 148.0,39.5 150.0,36.7 152.0,39.5 153.9,42.3 155.9,45.1 157.9,47.9 159.8,50.7 161.8,53.4 163.8,56.2 165.8,59.0 167.7,61.8 169.7,64.6 171.7,67.4 173.6,70.2 175.6,73.0 177.6,75.7 179.5,78.5 181.5,81.3 183.5,84.1 185.5,86.9 187.4,89.7 189.4,92.5 191.4,95.2 193.3,98.0 195.3,100.8 197.3,103.6 199.2,106.4 201.2,109.2 203.2,112.0 205.2,114.8 207.1,117.5 209.1,120.3 209.1,120.3 207.1,122.2 205.2,123.9 203.2,125.6 201.2,127.3 199.2,128.8 197.3,130.4 195.3,131.8 193.3,133.2 191.4,134.5 189.4,135.8 187.4,137.0 185.5,138.2 183.5,139.2 181.5,140.3 179.5,141.2 177.6,142.1 175.6,143.0 173.6,143.7 171.7,144.4 169.7,145.1 167.7,145.7 165.8,146.2 163.8,146.7 161.8,147.1 159.8,147.4 157.9,147.7 155.9,147.9 153.9,148.1 152.0,148.2 150.0,148.2 148.0,148.2 146.1,148.1 144.1,147.9 142.1,147.7 140.2,147.4 138.2,147.1 136.2,146.7 134.2,146.2 132.3,145.7 130.3,145.1 128.3,144.4 126.4,143.7 124.4,143.0 122.4,142.1 120.5,141.2 118.5,140.3 116.5,139.2 114.5,138.2 112.6,137.0 110.6,135.8 108.6,134.5 106.7,133.2 104.7,131.8 102.7,130.4 100.8,128.8 98.8,127.3 96.8,125.6 94.8,123.9 92.9,122.2 90.9,120.3' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='37.7,195.6 41.5,190.3 45.2,185.0 49.0,179.7 52.7,174.4 56.4,169.1 60.2,163.8 63.9,158.5 67.7,153.2 71.4,147.9 75.2,142.6 78.9,137.3 82.6,132.0 86.4,126.7 90.1,121.4 93.9,116.1 97.6,110.9 101.3,105.6 105.1,100.3 108.8,95.0 112.6,89.7 116.3,84.4 120.1,79.1 123.8,73.8 127.5,68.5 131.3,63.2 135.0,57.9 138.8,52.6 142.