</div><div class='res'>El simétrico de \\(P\\) respecto de \\(r\\) es \\(P'\\left(0,\\ \\frac{13}{5},\\ -\\frac{9}{5}\\right)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(\\overrightarrow{PM}=\\left(-1,\\ -\\frac{1}{5},\\ -\\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\) es perpendicular a \\(\\vec d\\): \\(0\\cdot(-1)-2\\cdot(-\\frac{1}{5})+(-\\frac{2}{5})=0\\) ✓.</i><p><b>Distancia.</b> \\(M\\left(1,\\frac{14}5,-\\frac75\\right)\\) es la proyección de \\(P\\) sobre \\(r\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>El camino más corto de un punto a una recta es el segmento perpendicular a la recta.</i>:</p>\\[d(P,r)=|\\overrightarrow{PM}|=\\left|\\left(-1,-\\frac15,-\\frac25\\right)\\right|=\\sqrt{1+\\frac1{25}+\\frac4{25}}=\\frac{\\sqrt{30}}5\\]<div class='res'>\\(d(P,r)=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{30}}5\\approx1{,}095\\) unidades</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"simet","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-3-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"En el primer cuadrante representamos un rectángulo de tal manera que tiene un vértice en el origen de coordenadas y el vértice opuesto en la parábola \\(y=-x^2+3\\). Determina las dimensiones del rectángulo para que su área sea máxima.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El vértice opuesto al origen es \\((x,3-x^2)\\), con \\(x\\gt0\\) y \\(3-x^2\\gt0\\): \\(x\\in(0,\\sqrt3)\\). Los lados miden \\(x\\) y \\(3-x^2\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='53.9,80.5 56.7,80.5 59.6,80.5 62.4,80.5 65.2,80.5 68.0,80.5 70.9,80.5 73.7,80.5 76.5,80.5 79.3,80.5 82.2,80.5 85.0,80.5 87.8,80.5 90.7,80.5 93.5,80.5 96.3,80.5 99.1,80.5 102.0,80.5 104.8,80.5 107.6,80.5 110.4,80.5 113.3,80.5 116.1,80.5 118.9,80.5 121.7,80.5 124.6,80.5 127.4,80.5 130.2,80.5 133.0,80.5 135.9,80.5 138.7,80.5 141.5,80.5 144.3,80.5 147.2,80.5 150.0,80.5 152.8,80.5 155.7,80.5 158.5,80.5 161.3,80.5 164.1,80.5 167.0,80.5 167.0,167.0 164.1,167.0 161.3,167.0 158.5,167.0 155.7,167.0 152.8,167.0 150.0,167.0 147.2,167.0 144.3,167.0 141.5,167.0 138.7,167.0 135.9,167.0 133.0,167.0 130.2,167.0 127.4,167.0 124.6,167.0 121.7,167.0 118.9,167.0 116.1,167.0 113.3,167.0 110.4,167.0 107.6,167.0 104.8,167.0 102.0,167.0 99.1,167.0 96.3,167.0 93.5,167.0 90.7,167.0 87.8,167.0 85.0,167.0 82.2,167.0 79.3,167.0 76.5,167.0 73.7,167.0 70.9,167.0 68.0,167.0 65.2,167.0 62.4,167.0 59.6,167.0 56.7,167.0 53.9,167.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='53.9,37.3 59.0,37.4 64.1,37.6 69.2,38.1 74.3,38.7 79.3,39.5 84.4,40.4 89.5,41.6 94.6,42.9 99.7,44.4 104.8,46.1 109.9,47.9 115.0,49.9 120.0,52.1 125.1,54.5 130.2,57.0 135.3,59.7 140.4,62.6 145.5,65.7 150.6,68.9 155.7,72.3 160.7,75.9 165.8,79.7 170.9,83.6 176.0,87.7 181.1,92.0 186.2,96.5 191.3,101.1 196.3,106.0 201.4,110.9 206.5,116.1 211.6,121.4 216.7,127.0 221.8,132.7 226.9,138.5 232.0,144.6 237.0,150.8 242.1,157.2 247.2,163.7 252.3,170.5 257.4,177.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='167.0' cy='80.5' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='173.0' y='74.5'>(x, 3 − x²)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 167.0H294.0M53.9 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='167.0' y1='164.0' x2='167.0' y2='170.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='164.0' y='181.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='50.9' y1='123.8' x2='56.9' y2='123.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='37.9' y='127.8' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='50.9' y1='80.5' x2='56.9' y2='80.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='37.9' y='84.5' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='50.9' y1='37.3' x2='56.9' y2='37.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='37.9' y='41.3' font-size='10'>3</text></svg></div><p><b>Función a maximizar:</b> \\(A(x)=x(3-x^2)=3x-x^3\\). Es polinómica<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(A'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[A'(x)=3-3x^2=0\\iff\\boxed{x=1}\\ (x\\gt0)\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 228 108' width='100%' style='max-width:274px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H214' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M190 56L194 48M194 56L198 48M198 56L202 48M202 56L206 48M206 56L210 48M210 56L214 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>√3</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(½) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(1,5) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(A\\) crece en \\((0,1)\\) debido a que \\(A'(x)\\gt0\\) y decrece en \\((1,\\sqrt3)\\) debido a que \\(A'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>: el máximo está en \\(x=1\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>, con altura \\(3-1=2\\).</p><div class='res'>Base 1 y altura 2 (área máxima 2)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-3-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/2}x\\cos(x)\\,dx\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i>, con \\(u=x\\), \\(dv=\\cos x\\,dx\\):</p>\\[\\int x\\cos x\\,dx=x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x-\\int\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\,dx=x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+\\cos x\\]<p>Por la regla de Barrow<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Barrow: \\(\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a)\\), siendo \\(F\\) una primitiva de \\(f\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\Bigl[x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+\\cos x\\Bigr]_0^{\\pi/2}=\\left(\\frac\\pi2+0\\right)-(0+1)=\\frac\\pi2-1\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\dfrac\\pi2-1\\approx0{,}571\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"part","apartados":""},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-3-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}3&0&\\lambda\\\\-5&\\lambda&-5\\\\\\lambda&0&3\\end{pmatrix}\\)","apartados":["(1 p.) Determina los valores de \\(\\lambda\\) para los que la matriz \\(A-2I\\) tiene inversa, siendo \\(I\\) la matriz identidad de orden 3.","(1,5 p.) Para \\(\\lambda=-2\\), resuelve la ecuación matricial \\(AX=2X+I\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[A-2I=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&\\lambda\\\\-5&\\lambda-2&-5\\\\\\lambda&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Tiene inversa si y solo si su determinante no es nulo. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A-2I|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&\\lambda\\\\-5&\\lambda-2&-5\\\\\\lambda&0&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(\\lambda - 2+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(\\lambda^{3} - 2 \\lambda^{2}+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=(\\lambda-2)(1-\\lambda^2)\\]<div class='res'>\\(A-2I\\) tiene inversa si \\(\\lambda\\neq2\\), \\(\\lambda\\neq1\\) y \\(\\lambda\\neq-1\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(AX=2X+I\\iff AX-2X=I\\iff(A-2I)X=I\\iff X=(A-2I)^{-1}\\)<i class='n' data-t='err'>Al sacar factor común, \\(2X=2IX\\): queda \\((A-2I)X\\), no \\((A-2)X\\).</i>. Con \\(\\lambda=-2\\) existe:</p>\\[|A-2I|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&-2\\\\-5&-4&-5\\\\-2&0&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-4+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(-16+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=12\\]<p>Como \\(|A-2I|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(A-2I^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|A-2I|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A-2I)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}A-2I=\\begin{pmatrix}-4 & 15 & -8\\\\0 & -3 & 0\\\\-8 & 15 & -4\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow A-2I^{-1}=\\frac1{12}\\begin{pmatrix}-4 & 0 & -8\\\\15 & -3 & 15\\\\-8 & 0 & -4\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}- \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{2}{3}\\\\\\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4}\\\\- \\frac{2}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{1}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}- \\frac{1}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{2}{3}\\\\\\frac{5}{4} & - \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{5}{4}\\\\- \\frac{2}{3} & 0 & - \\frac{1}{3}\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"inv","apartados":"a, b"},{"tema":"matrices","tipo":"ecmat","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2011-reserva-3-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera los planos \\(\\pi_1\\) y \\(\\pi_2\\) dados respectivamente por las ecuaciones \\((x,y,z)=(-2,0,7)+\\lambda(1,-2,0)+\\mu(0,1,-1)\\) y \\(2x+y-z+5=0\\). Determina los puntos de la recta \\(r\\) definida por \\(x=y+1=\\dfrac{z-1}{-3}\\) que equidistan de \\(\\pi_1\\) y \\(\\pi_2\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p><b>Implícita de </b>\\(\\pi_1\\)<b>.</b> Normal: \\((1,-2,0)\\times(0,1,-1)=(2,1,1)\\). Con el punto \\((-2,0,7)\\): \\(2x+y+z+D=0\\), \\(-4+7+D=0\\iff D=-3\\). Es \\(\\pi_1\\equiv2x+y+z-3=0\\).</p><p><b>Recta </b>\\(r\\) en paramétricas: \\(x=t\\), \\(y=t-1\\), \\(z=1-3t\\).</p><p>Al pedirse una distancia, uso la fórmula de la distancia de un punto a un plano<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(d(P,\\pi)=\\dfrac{|Ax_0+By_0+Cz_0+D|}{\\sqrt{A^2+B^2+C^2}}\\).</i>; los dos planos tienen \\(\\sqrt{4+1+1}=\\sqrt6\\):</p>\\[2t+(t-1)+(1-3t)-3=-3,\\qquad2t+(t-1)-(1-3t)+5=6t+3\\]\\[\\frac{|-3|}{\\sqrt6}=\\frac{|6t+3|}{\\sqrt6}\\iff6t+3=3\\ \\text{ o }\\ 6t+3=-3\\iff t=0\\ \\text{ o }\\ t=-1\\]<div class='res'>\\((0,-1,1)\\) y \\((-1,-2,4)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\(r\\) es paralela a \\(\\pi_1\\) (todos sus puntos están a la misma distancia de él), y corta a \\(\\pi_2\\).</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":""},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2011-RESERVA_3.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"}]}